# The build context is the whole component. The builder needs the Go module, and the
# runtime stage copies static/, so both stay; everything else is dropped.
#
# A deny-list, not an opt-in: `*` followed by re-includes copied only top-level files under
# podman, because an excluded directory is never descended into.
.git*
.github
.qubership
helm-template
dist
*.md
*.cmd
*.yml
LICENSE
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.lycheeignore
